- **Drive Dashboard : course sur le payload de drag global (window.__zrDragPayload) -> mauvaise cible ou drop perdu** — `src/components/DriveDashboard.jsx:236-249 (onDragOver/onDrop lisent window.__zrDragPayload) + :381-382 (onDragStart pose / onDragEnd remet a null) + :152-160 (onFileDragStart pose dataTransfer)` _[Vues/apps]_
